{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself trapped inside this magical dome, formed by the 4 elements of nature: water, earth, air, and fire. To escape, you must explore your surroundings carefully, unravel enigmas, and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191420/extras/Domeedited.gif?t=1741742927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore however you want, in your own time, in whatever order you want, and undo the magic of each of the 4 elements, one at a time, by finding and reaching their respective totems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191420/extras/Totems.gif?t=1741742927\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a first-person perspective, you will have to use logic, think outside the box, and interact with the environment in unusual ways if you want to escape this mysterious magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First person perspective;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D movement;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free, non-linear exploration;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Logic puzzles;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Environmental puzzles;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2-5 hours of gameplay;  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D pixel art stylized graphics</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You spin me right round","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191420/278ad4713db61f3e8a35f88bf8a3de87dbf56598.jpg"},{"name":"Heather","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191420/4fbc648528bcf1b013f0039a56569ace8e079ddf.jpg"},{"name":"The secret in